  "Question": "The fraction \\(\\dfrac13:\\)",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "equals \\(0.33333333\\)",
    "B": "is less than \\(0.33333333\\) by \\(\\dfrac1{3\\cdot10^8}\\)",
    "C": "is less than \\(0.33333333\\) by \\(\\dfrac1{3\\cdot10^9}\\)",
    "D": "is greater than \\(0.33333333\\) by\n\\(\\dfrac1{3\\cdot10^8}\\)",
    "E": "is greater than \\(0.33333333\\) by \\(\\dfrac1{3\\cdot10^9}\\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "D",
  "Solution": "The decimal has eight digits after the decimal point, so\n\\[\n0.33333333=\\frac{33333333}{10^8}.\n\\]\nSubtract it from \\(\\frac13\\), using a common denominator:\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac13-0.33333333\n&=\\frac{10^8-3(33333333)}{3\\cdot10^8}\\\\\n&=\\frac{100000000-99999999}{3\\cdot10^8}\\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{3\\cdot10^8}>0.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\nThus \\(\\frac13\\) is greater than the decimal by \\(\\boxed{\\frac{1}{3\\cdot10^8}}\\), choice D.",
